{
    "title": "Couple Life 3D",
    "description": "\u2764\ufe0f Welcome to Couple Life 3D, a great RELATIONSHIP simulation game! \u2764\ufe0f\r\n\r\nThis interactive game lets you LIVE your stories with love, romance, adventure, and drama. You get to make choices and choose your destiny.\r\n\r\nRelationship is so much fun! But a lot of dramas can happen in a relationship.\r\n- Are you in your honeymoon phase, and you always want to be together?\r\n- Do you play passionate and dirty games?\r\n- Do you prank your other half?\r\n- Do you cheat on each other?\r\n\r\nIn this game, you can experience all kinds of dramatic events and make your own decisions!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE:\r\n\u2b50 Beautiful 3D graphics\r\n\u2b50 100% free game\r\n\u2b50 Fun and addictive gameplay\r\n\u2b50 Easy control\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD FOR FREE NOW! Play through many levels of fun challenges between couples! Take your Couple Life to the next Level!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2764\ufe0f Welcome to Couple Life 3D, a great RELATIONSHIP simulation game! \u2764\ufe0f<br><br>This interactive game lets you LIVE your stories with love, romance, adventure, and drama. You get to make choices and choose your destiny.<br><br>Relationship is so much fun! But a lot of dramas can happen in a relationship.<br>- Are you in your honeymoon phase, and you always want to be together?<br>- Do you play passionate and dirty games?<br>- Do you prank your other half?<br>- Do you cheat on each other?<br><br>In this game, you can experience all kinds of dramatic events and make your own decisions!<br><br>GAME FEATURE:<br>\u2b50 Beautiful 3D graphics<br>\u2b50 100% free game<br>\u2b50 Fun and addictive gameplay<br>\u2b50 Easy control<br><br>DOWNLOAD FOR FREE NOW! Play through many levels of fun challenges between couples! Take your Couple Life to the next Level!",
